          <article class="card rounded-2xl p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-black">Address &amp; getting there</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-black/65">{attraction.fullName} sits at {attraction.streetAddress}, {attraction.city}, {attraction.state} {attraction.postalCode}, {attraction.country}. From Clock Tower it is roughly 9 km along Mussoorie Road, and taxis, auto-rickshaws and private cars are the usual options.</p></article>
          <article class="card rounded-2xl p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-black">Timings &amp; tickets</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-black/65">Reported opening hours are about 10:00–17:00, generally closed on Mondays. Adult tickets are quoted at roughly ₹100 with free entry for children up to 12 years. Treat the counter as the final authority on the day.</p></article>
