        <ul class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
          <li class="card rounded-2xl p-6"><strong class="text-lg">{attraction.nearbyLandmarks[0]}</strong><p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-black/65">Around 2 km from the zoo, this stream-cut gorge between rock walls is the easiest single add-on to a {attraction.shortName} visit.</p></li>
